<?xpacket begin="ï»¿" id="W5M0MpCehiHzreSzNTczkc9d"?>
<x:xmpmeta xmlns:x="adobe:ns:meta/">
  <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#">
    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">A Pale Imitation</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;If it's all just a means to an end, then this is how it goes: with Not-Adora winding an arm up and around Catra's shoulder blades, with her other hand resting on Catra's waist, and with her desperate, silent whimpers betraying her pent up fervor.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This is the attraction of this breed of establishment, isn't it?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The people that come here want to be swallowed whole. Theyâ€™re impulsive. They do not want to waste their days or nights waiting for something to â€˜maybe happenâ€™, so they don't. Instead, they come here and they act without thinking past the moment they're in.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;_____&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Upset and confused, Catra yearns for Adora but finds someone else instead. What she doesn't know is that Adora is searching for her too.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>InErosion</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
      </dc:creator>
      <dc:subject>
